        "original_id": "b286e314-66fa-597f-b3ad-e8b1887f4009",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Igor Krutoy, Raimonds Pauls, Alla Pugacheva, Sandhy Sondoro\n- Events: New Wave\n- Places: Jūrmala, Latvia\n- Roles: young performers of popular music, musical performer, composer, pianist\n\nFacts:\n- Alla Pugacheva was born on 15 April 1949 and is a Soviet and Russian musical performer.\n- Alla Pugacheva's career started in 1965 and has continued since then.\n- New Wave is an international contest for young performers of popular music that was founded in 2002 by Russian composer Igor Krutoy and Latvian pianist and composer Raimonds Pauls.\n- New Wave was later enhanced by Russian superstar Alla Pugacheva.\n- Sandhy Sondoro is best known for winning the 2009 International Contest of Young Pop Singer New Wave in Jūrmala, Latvia.",
